	  <headword id="idola106">[faillinn, coileir, bann]</headword>
	  <description>Ministers of the Protestant Churches wear a ‘faillinn’ (robe) and ‘coileir’ in reverse to ordinary collars with the stud at the back. The minister’s tie, ‘bann’, is of white linen.</description>
